# Reverse-engineering material stays private — EXCEPT msgtool, which the image
# genuinely needs (Dockerfile.local copies it, and the GitHub Actions builder
# can only see committed files).
#
# ⚠ Note the form: ignore the CONTENTS (local_recon/*), not the folder itself.
# Writing `local_recon/` stops git descending into it and the `!` exception
# below would silently never match.
local_recon/*
!local_recon/msgtool

# Working session notes — internal, not for the public repo.
MOOVAIR_LOCAL_LOG.md
MOOVAIR_LOCAL_PLAN.md
CLAUDE-moovair-local.md
